<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>流程标题显式提交、名称写入与保存边界</title><style>body{max-width:1300px;margin:auto;padding:24px;background:#101c2d;color:#e3eefb;font:15px/1.7 Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif}a{color:#a3d8ff}article{background:#1a2e45;padding:18px;margin:16px 0;border:1px solid #4c647c}.unknown{border-style:dashed}.notice{padding:15px;border-left:4px solid #ddaa6a;background:#253a50}summary{cursor:pointer}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.6 Consolas,monospace}</style><a href="workflow-rendering-entry-audit.html">画布呈现</a> · <a href="main-ui-map.html">主架构</a><h1>流程标题显式提交、名称写入与保存边界</h1><p class="notice">重命名：资源命令/编辑旗 → HeadReNameTextBox的显式UpdateSource → 装饰器Name → 模块/流程各自SDK名称操作。保存是另一个消费者，未证明退出编辑立即写文件。没有按惯例补造Escape取消、绑定错误恢复或方案往返。</p><p>33个原件独立CIL体；实际样式绑定、原生序列化和运行验收均未闭合。</p><article id="WTN01" class="source-confirmed"><h2>WTN01 · 节点/流程标题与重命名声明 → Name Explicit绑定及RenameCommand / RenameWindowCommand</h2><p>source-confirmed：所选NORMAL节点标题HeadReNameTextBox.Text绑定Name（TwoWay、UpdateSourceTrigger=Explicit），IsReName另TwoWay；流程标题和Group标题也声明相同提交形式。所选右键重命名项调用RenameWindowCommand，另有RenameCommand项；前者声明默认禁用，仅IsForbidden=false且IsLoadFailed=false启用。这是具体资源入口，不把所有菜单、F2或双击都当作同一路重命名。</p><p>待追：diagramitemtemplate/ProcedureConfigControl原BAML byte-equal父证据已在既有账本，真实模板选择、其它菜单和快捷键全集未在本片运行核验。</p><details><summary>NORMAL title explicit binding · local-extracted-resource</summary><pre>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/base/diagramitemtemplate.xaml:1143–1143
SHA256 95dc48af35a601585c893a2377665781bc4a72a2d5b2ab562d82b4ba0dc5f4f9
          &lt;appUi:HeadReNameTextBox Name=&quot;itemName&quot; Grid.Column=&quot;1&quot; Background=&quot;#00FFFFFF&quot; FontWeight=&quot;Bold&quot; FontSize=&quot;12&quot; VerticalAlignment=&quot;Center&quot; BorderThickness=&quot;0&quot; MaxLength=&quot;{x:Static local:DiagramItem.MaxNameLenth}&quot; Foreground=&quot;{Color:ColorResourceBinding Col_EditProcess_Foreground}&quot; Text=&quot;{Binding Name, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=Explicit}&quot; IsReName=&quot;{Binding IsReName, Mode=TwoWay}&quot; /&gt;</pre></details><details><summary>Rename window menu declaration · local-extracted-resource</summary><pre>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/base/diagramitemtemplate.xaml:1074–1089
