SHA256 a91f89dd2214f3b4cc3ad432d14caf8732d11bc376b29c64ad1b8a75a982f106
                      &lt;appUi:HeadReNameTextBox Name=&quot;headText&quot; Foreground=&quot;{DynamicResource Col_ProcessBar_Foreground}&quot; BorderThickness=&quot;0&quot; Background=&quot;#00FFFFFF&quot; MaxLength=&quot;64&quot; FontSize=&quot;14&quot; Margin=&quot;8,0,0,0&quot; VerticalAlignment=&quot;Center&quot; MaxWidth=&quot;240&quot; Text=&quot;{Binding Name, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=Explicit}&quot; IsReName=&quot;{Binding IsReName, Mode=TwoWay}&quot; /&gt;</pre></details></article><article id="WTN02" class="source-confirmed"><h2>WTN02 · VmModuleBaseDecorator.Rename命令 → IsReName=true与有限弹窗分支</h2><p>source-confirmed：RenameCommandExe仅IsReName=true；RenameWindowCommandExe先置true，再new ModifyName(this).ShowDialog。IsReName值变化先写字段，变true时注册RootOperation再通知；不因失败的后续窗口构造/注册而声称回滚。ModifyName带参构造仅decorator is VmModuleDecorator才赋DataContext；不能泛称所有流程/Group装饰器都可用同一弹窗。SearchClick只清DataContext再Close，并未显式UpdateSource。</p><p>待追：ModifyName默认TextBox绑定的真实提交/失焦顺序、关闭按钮/取消和各装饰器实际入口组合未验；不以普通WPF惯例补齐。</p><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.VmModuleBaseDecorator::get_RenameCommand · original-managed-cil</summary><pre>docs/architecture-recovery/workflow-title-commit-audit.cil.json:3937–3956
