        &lt;Button Margin=&quot;40,0,0,0&quot; Style=&quot;{StaticResource BlueButtonStyle}&quot; Width=&quot;56&quot; Content=&quot;{DynamicResource Confirm}&quot; Click=&quot;SearchClick&quot; /&gt;</pre></details></article><article id="WTN03" class="source-confirmed"><h2>WTN03 · HeadReNameTextBox.IsReName变化 → 进入Focus/SelectAll，退出旧true时UpdateSource</h2><p>source-confirmed：依赖属性默认false，变更回调取OldValue；NewValue为true先Focus和SelectAll，OldValue为true才取TextProperty.BindingExpression并UpdateSource。构造订阅KeyDown/LostFocus并ContextMenu=null；Return和失焦只置IsReName=false。因此显式提交由true→false触发；该体没有Escape取消/恢复原文、bindingExpression空检查或catch，不能宣称所有结束方式都安全提交。</p><p>待追：WPF BindingExpression内部校验/异常传播、焦点路由/输入法/鼠标取消与其它处理器未验；没有本体Escape不证明全程序无取消。</p><details><summary>Apps.PcUI.HeadReNameTextBox::.cctor · original-managed-cil</summary><pre>docs/architecture-recovery/workflow-title-commit-audit.cil.json:166–185
